  "description": "Change of use of 1500 sq metres of industrial/warehouse floorspace [B1c, B2 and B8] at ground floor level to Computer Data Centre to provide computer back up [B1 (a)] and provision of mezzanine comprising 500 sq metres floorspace to accommodate air conditioning plant and equipment for data centre, and external alterations to south elevation of building to incorporate louvres.",
