  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - No more than 500 sq metres of mezzanine floorspace shall be provided for the mechanical plant rooms, and this shall be used for plant maintenance purposes and for no other purpose.",
    "Condition : 4 - The mezzanine over the Data Centre Hall shall function as a blast protection measure and shall not be used to provide additional floorspace for the building without the consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 5 - The floorspace subject of the application shall be used for purposes within Classes B1(a), B1(c), B2 or B8 of the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987 as Amended.",
